WEBVTT

01:42.600 --> 01:44.920
I heard that all the Beauties with burns

01:45.000 --> 01:47.160
will follow Mr. Yue Qin back to Xiyan

01:47.240 --> 01:48.840
under the pretense
of failing their studies.

01:49.480 --> 01:51.600
Really? We're going back to Xiyan?

01:52.360 --> 01:53.520
I don't want to return to Xiyan.

01:54.160 --> 01:56.000
My father sold me
to the peace-making marriage delegation.

01:56.080 --> 01:56.920
I don't have a home anymore.

01:57.000 --> 01:59.200
I'd rather stay
in Great Yan and seek fortune.

01:59.280 --> 02:01.080
Jia, it's alright.

02:01.160 --> 02:03.280
You can come to my home.
My home will be your home too.

02:03.360 --> 02:04.280
I'm not going.

02:04.360 --> 02:06.880
What if your cute neighbor falls for me?

02:06.960 --> 02:08.000
What will you do then?

02:08.520 --> 02:09.520
That won't happen.

02:09.600 --> 02:10.919
He only likes me.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.040
He never said he liked you.

02:12.120 --> 02:13.160
How do you know?

02:13.240 --> 02:17.120
QINGQU COURTYARD

02:17.200 --> 02:18.480
It is raining.

02:23.360 --> 02:25.720
He… He took good care of me.

02:25.800 --> 02:26.640
How did he take care of you?

02:26.720 --> 02:27.920
What did he do?

02:28.000 --> 02:29.160
He…

02:29.840 --> 02:31.680
When it was cold,
he told me to put on more clothes.

02:31.760 --> 02:33.280
When we ate,
he worried I hadn't eaten enough.

02:34.240 --> 02:35.360
Is that love?

02:36.320 --> 02:39.000
Yeah. I also tell you to eat
and dress warmly.

02:39.880 --> 02:40.720
Well,

02:42.120 --> 02:43.560
when I was happy, he was happy.

02:43.640 --> 02:46.000
When I was upset, he cheered me up.

02:47.240 --> 02:48.360
And he

02:48.440 --> 02:51.040
remembers everything I say,
sometimes better than I do.

02:51.880 --> 02:54.200
So, that must be love, right?

02:55.560 --> 02:57.160
I don't know if he likes you,

02:57.880 --> 03:00.160
but I know you like him.

03:02.960 --> 03:04.640
Stop that.

03:08.360 --> 03:10.720
Mei, what do you think?

03:10.800 --> 03:12.160
Does he like me?

03:14.400 --> 03:15.640
Why don't you ask him yourself?

03:16.320 --> 03:18.560
Exactly. When you return to Xiyan,
ask him.

03:18.640 --> 03:21.600
If he doesn't dare admit he likes you,
then forget about him.

03:30.560 --> 03:32.080
Mei, try this.

03:33.480 --> 03:35.760
The flower cakes at the Court
of State Ceremonial look beautiful

03:35.840 --> 03:37.000
but don't taste sweet.

03:58.120 --> 03:58.960
It's sweet.

04:00.920 --> 04:02.320
- Mei.
- Where are you going?

04:02.400 --> 04:05.040
It's still raining.

04:05.120 --> 04:06.280
Mei!

04:14.120 --> 04:15.040
The Beauties are about to be ennobled.

04:15.120 --> 04:16.200
No peace-making marriage Beauty is allowed

04:16.279 --> 04:17.480
to leave the Court of State Ceremonial
without an imperial edict.

04:38.040 --> 04:40.000
She has already taken leave
from Attendant Shang.

04:41.640 --> 04:43.840
Mr. Yue Qin. Miss.

04:44.960 --> 04:47.320
The Emperor's decree forbids any Beauty
from leaving the Court of State Ceremonial

04:47.400 --> 04:49.000
before the ennobling ceremony.

04:49.080 --> 04:51.880
Even with leave granted,
they can't go out.

04:53.280 --> 04:57.160
I've heard this restriction
is because of the Xiyan spies.

04:57.240 --> 04:58.880
Before,

04:58.960 --> 05:01.200
it was easy to take leave
because you were helping.

05:02.560 --> 05:04.680
But now that you're returning to Xiyan,

05:05.280 --> 05:07.400
please be cautious

05:08.000 --> 05:10.600
to avoid bringing trouble yourself.

05:11.800 --> 05:13.280
Thank you for the reminder.

05:22.680 --> 05:24.880
Apologies, I couldn't help you this time.

05:24.960 --> 05:28.280
I see now why it was so easy
to take leave before.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.760
It was because you were helping me.

05:30.400 --> 05:32.360
Thanks, Mr. Yue Qin.

05:32.440 --> 05:33.520
Let me walk you back.

06:17.520 --> 06:20.640
Your Highness. Your Highness.
I've uncovered something.

06:20.720 --> 06:23.000
The Beauty burns were caused
by people from Prince Jing's mansion.

06:25.680 --> 06:28.280
That's the real reason
they're being sent back to Xiyan.

06:30.120 --> 06:31.480
So, it wasn't about spies.

06:32.040 --> 06:34.720
They were just pawns
in Great Yan's power struggle.

06:36.760 --> 06:37.600
Mei Lin.

06:38.480 --> 06:41.000
How would they care about pawns?

06:41.080 --> 06:44.040
Your Highness. Should we warn her?

06:45.480 --> 06:48.440
Of course, but not yet.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.280
Send word to the Fanghua Palace

06:51.360 --> 06:53.480
that I need Zigu's help.

06:54.720 --> 06:55.560
Yes.

07:06.240 --> 07:09.720
Jinghe's affairs are now widely known.

07:11.520 --> 07:15.720
With that Mei Lin around,
Luomei won't choose him.

07:30.800 --> 07:33.840
Your Majesty, this is this year's new tea.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.360
I selected it myself.

07:36.520 --> 07:37.760
Please have a taste.

07:46.440 --> 07:48.240
Excuse me, Your Majesty.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.800
Concubine Yan,
do you have something to tell me?

07:55.280 --> 07:57.960
Your Majesty, I have a request.

07:59.560 --> 08:02.680
If you're asking for the dagger back,
it's still too soon.

08:04.000 --> 08:04.840
No, it's not that.

08:04.920 --> 08:06.000
Then, what is it?

08:07.240 --> 08:10.280
I give you my permission
to see your brother off to Xiyan.

08:10.920 --> 08:11.760
Really?

08:12.800 --> 08:15.320
Your Majesty,
you truly are the best in the world.

08:15.400 --> 08:19.000
In the future, just tell me what you want.

08:19.080 --> 08:21.680
Does that mean
you'll agree to everything I ask?

08:21.760 --> 08:23.360
That depends on what you ask for.

08:24.640 --> 08:26.680
This is the first thing
I've ever asked of you.

08:26.760 --> 08:28.200
You'll say yes, right?

08:28.920 --> 08:30.240
Didn't I already grant your wish?

08:30.320 --> 08:32.080
I'm letting you see your brother off,
aren't I?

08:32.159 --> 08:33.919
That doesn't count. I didn't ask for that.

08:34.000 --> 08:35.640
You offered it yourself.

08:35.720 --> 08:37.679
Now, I'm curious.

08:38.280 --> 08:40.280
What is it that you want?

08:43.360 --> 08:44.560
Your Majesty,

08:44.640 --> 08:47.160
tomorrow is the ennobling ceremony
for the peace-making marriage Beauties.

08:47.240 --> 08:49.800
I'd like to ask you
to place Mei Lin in Fanghua Palace.

08:51.120 --> 08:51.960
Mei Lin?

08:53.040 --> 08:54.680
Jinghe's woman?

08:57.240 --> 08:58.560
Your Majesty,

08:58.640 --> 09:01.280
Mei Lin once saved my life
on our journey to the capital.

09:01.360 --> 09:03.640
I merely want to repay her kindness.

09:04.960 --> 09:05.960
People at the Court
of State Ceremonial say

09:06.040 --> 09:09.360
Prince Jing is deeply in love with her.

09:10.120 --> 09:13.120
But I worry she might be wronged.

09:13.200 --> 09:14.200
After all…

09:15.600 --> 09:16.960
Good thing I caught myself,

09:17.040 --> 09:18.320
so it doesn't count as defying your will.

09:18.920 --> 09:21.640
Are you worried that Jinghe
will take revenge on her privately?

09:22.440 --> 09:23.520
Do not worry.

09:24.280 --> 09:25.240
He won't.

09:29.040 --> 09:30.320
Your Majesty,

09:30.400 --> 09:34.120
please let Mei Lin stay
in the Fanghua Palace for one year.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.480
When she marries,
she can leave from there,

09:36.560 --> 09:40.760
which will raise her status
and fulfill my debt of gratitude.

09:41.360 --> 09:43.960
If Prince Jing's love is true,

09:44.040 --> 09:45.640
he won't be afraid of the test of time.

09:51.880 --> 09:53.080
WEST MOUNTAIN MINE

09:53.160 --> 09:55.000
The West Mountain Mine

09:55.760 --> 09:57.160
and Lushan Hunting Grounds

10:00.360 --> 10:02.280
are only 50 li apart.

10:04.080 --> 10:06.400
My lord, isn't this too risky?

10:07.960 --> 10:10.520
This is the only way to win.

10:11.280 --> 10:12.360
If we rescue the hostage, Li Qing,

10:12.440 --> 10:14.000
we can bring down the Crown Prince
in one move.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.120
WAN'AN HALL

10:37.680 --> 10:40.240
Your Highness, Mr. Yue Qin has come

10:40.320 --> 10:41.520
to bid farewell.

10:49.240 --> 10:50.520
What are you doing…?

10:52.280 --> 10:55.360
In the three years in Yan,
I received much care from you.

10:56.040 --> 10:57.200
As I am about to depart,

10:57.280 --> 10:58.880
I bring a small gift to express my thanks.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.520
You are my father's friend.

11:01.600 --> 11:03.400
It's not even considered offering care.

11:03.480 --> 11:05.480
I'm ashamed to accept the gift.

11:06.240 --> 11:07.720
Please,

11:07.800 --> 11:10.200
Your Highness.
don't be too hasty to refuse.

11:12.480 --> 11:14.240
These are collections of folk legends

11:14.320 --> 11:16.960
I've gathered over the years.

11:17.720 --> 11:20.480
His Majesty often reads them
for both entertainment

11:20.560 --> 11:22.160
and understanding the people.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.320
Also,

11:24.400 --> 11:27.040
this ̀is a specially blended incense

11:27.120 --> 11:28.400
containing tianmu,

11:28.480 --> 11:31.520
longxian, sandalwood, and agarwood.

11:31.600 --> 11:33.880
It calms the mind, dispels negativity,
and clears the senses.

11:34.480 --> 11:37.800
His Majesty has been using this
to ease his burden of state affairs.

11:39.280 --> 11:41.680
So, that's the incense Father uses.

11:41.760 --> 11:44.400
No wonder
you're such close friends with him.

11:45.000 --> 11:46.720
Well then, thank you.

11:51.760 --> 11:54.560
Such a precious gift, Mr. Yue Qin.

11:54.640 --> 11:56.240
You should send one
to Prince Jing as well.

12:02.880 --> 12:05.240
A gift expresses gratitude for the past

12:05.320 --> 12:06.680
and goodwill for the future.

12:07.600 --> 12:09.120
In my view,

12:09.200 --> 12:11.480
the future of Great Yan rests with you,
Your Highness.

12:11.560 --> 12:14.000
So, this gift is only for you.

12:14.600 --> 12:15.640
Very well.

12:16.440 --> 12:17.280
But…

12:18.240 --> 12:21.360
Mr. Yue Qin, there's something else
I'd like to ask of you.

12:21.960 --> 12:23.560
Please speak.

12:29.120 --> 12:32.080
It's about the ten Beauties
who are to return with you to Xiyan.

12:32.160 --> 12:35.240
I've been thinking
about their suspicious origins.

12:35.840 --> 12:38.120
Father doesn't want to delve deeper
because of the political implications,

12:38.200 --> 12:40.520
but to avoid trouble in the future,

12:41.120 --> 12:43.240
they cannot live.

12:54.360 --> 12:58.480
If you are willing to ease my burden,

12:59.640 --> 13:00.840
why not come over

13:01.440 --> 13:03.080
and have a cup of tea with me?

13:34.880 --> 13:38.080
May I have the honor
of sailing the same boat as you,

13:38.160 --> 13:39.200
Your Highness?

13:41.160 --> 13:42.120
Good.

13:42.720 --> 13:44.480
Certainly. Certainly.

13:48.600 --> 13:52.200
Also, in my view,
the future of Xiyan rests with you.

13:52.760 --> 13:56.400
I wish you great success upon your return.

13:56.480 --> 13:57.640
Thank you, Your Highness.

13:59.520 --> 14:01.240
Mr. Yue Qin,

14:01.320 --> 14:04.640
I had thought you were a gentleman
who avoided the fray.

14:05.800 --> 14:08.440
I am just seeking a new path.

14:28.440 --> 14:30.800
My lord, you haven't slept all night.

14:30.880 --> 14:31.800
You should rest.

14:48.040 --> 14:50.040
Zhanyue Pavilion isn't that way.

14:51.160 --> 14:52.240
Where is he going?

15:00.960 --> 15:03.080
SHUANGLIN COURTYARD

15:07.880 --> 15:08.720
My lord.

15:10.160 --> 15:11.920
My lord. You've come early.

15:12.000 --> 15:14.520
The Beauties
won't be sent to their mansions

15:14.600 --> 15:16.000
until the Wu hour.

15:16.560 --> 15:18.600
- What time is it now?
- Just past the Chen hour.

15:20.440 --> 15:22.240
You'll go and personally fetch her
when the time comes.

15:22.320 --> 15:23.240
Yes, my lord.

15:37.720 --> 15:39.480
Her Majesty used to say

15:39.560 --> 15:41.280
that when you marry the one
you truly love,

15:41.960 --> 15:45.280
you'll know what it means
to long for someone day and night.

15:50.760 --> 15:54.200
Who would have thought we'd be so lucky
returning to Xiyan after all?

15:54.280 --> 15:57.040
Visiting Great Yan
has certainly been an eye-opener.

15:58.320 --> 15:59.600
Pity

15:59.680 --> 16:01.840
Dai didn't get to return with us.

16:04.560 --> 16:05.400
Yi.

16:06.320 --> 16:07.160
Jia.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.800
Take care on your journey.

16:09.400 --> 16:11.560
Mei, you take care as well.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.960
If Prince Jing doesn't treat you well,
just run.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.640
- Don't worry.
- I--

16:16.720 --> 16:18.080
Mei is more capable than any of us.

16:18.160 --> 16:19.800
Wherever she goes, she'll be fine.

16:23.240 --> 16:26.000
Send word when you've arrived.

16:27.120 --> 16:28.240
Take care, Mei.

16:30.440 --> 16:31.280
Get on the carriage.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.440
Take care!

16:49.800 --> 16:52.600
Brother, if you can't bear it,

16:52.680 --> 16:54.480
just come back to Great Yan
and bring Mei Lin away.

16:57.200 --> 17:00.360
Take care of yourself when I'm not here.

17:01.840 --> 17:03.440
If Prince Jing gives you trouble…

17:03.520 --> 17:05.440
Go to the Emperor for help.

17:06.960 --> 17:09.000
Do not worry.
I'll remember everything you said.

17:27.359 --> 17:29.240
Mei Lin! Mei Lin!

17:29.320 --> 17:30.160
Your Highness.

17:30.960 --> 17:33.200
My brother says
he'll return to Great Yan soon.

17:34.800 --> 17:37.560
Brother, both Mei Lin and I
will be waiting for you.

17:40.440 --> 17:42.440
Mr. Yue Qin, come back soon.

17:43.720 --> 17:44.760
Take care.

17:46.640 --> 17:47.880
Be careful.

17:49.320 --> 17:51.440
Mr. Yue Qin, it's getting late.

18:04.840 --> 18:07.600
Mei Lin, we need to hurry.
The imperial decree is coming soon.

18:07.680 --> 18:08.520
Okay.

18:13.640 --> 18:16.560
Yunyan, Yigu, Eastern Palace.

18:17.120 --> 18:21.000
Lan, Lingcao, Prince Qing's mansion.

18:23.480 --> 18:26.320
Ming, Yan, General Yin's mansion.

18:29.840 --> 18:30.680
This person…

18:31.640 --> 18:33.040
I think I've seen him before.

18:45.920 --> 18:47.200
He's one of the Eastern Palace's
secret guards.

18:49.360 --> 18:50.200
I need to inform Mr. Yue Qin now.

18:52.960 --> 18:55.720
Mei Lin. Mei Lin! Mei Lin!

18:55.800 --> 18:57.560
Your decree is coming soon.

18:57.640 --> 18:59.520
- Your Highness--
- The imperial decree has arrived.

19:02.840 --> 19:04.400
Mei Lin, receive the decree.

19:05.040 --> 19:06.280
Mei Lin from Xiyan,

19:06.360 --> 19:08.600
for your virtuous character
and exceptional talent,

19:08.680 --> 19:10.480
you are chosen to serve

19:10.560 --> 19:13.480
in the Fanghua Palace
under the care of Concubine Yan.

19:13.560 --> 19:14.880
The proclamation is now complete.

19:27.320 --> 19:29.000
Mei Lin, aren't you happy?

19:31.400 --> 19:35.920
I wasn't allowed to tell you before
because His Majesty

19:36.000 --> 19:38.560
didn't want Prince Jing
to know and interfere.

19:38.640 --> 19:39.640
- So…
- Your Highness,

19:40.560 --> 19:41.600
I understand your concerns.

19:42.200 --> 19:44.000
But I forgot to give something
to Mr. Yue Qin.

19:44.080 --> 19:45.000
I need to hurry and deliver it.

19:47.360 --> 19:48.560
Then go.

19:59.840 --> 20:01.880
You look better with a simple appearance.

20:12.160 --> 20:13.720
Actually, your festive look is nice too.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.280
My lord.

20:16.520 --> 20:17.360
- Has she--
- My lord.

20:17.440 --> 20:19.560
Miss Mei Lin has been assigned
to Fanghua Palace.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.880
My lord. Concubine Yan asked me
to inform you

20:25.560 --> 20:26.880
that Miss Mei Lin,

20:26.960 --> 20:29.080
unwilling to part from Mr. Yue Qin,
has gone to see him off.

20:29.680 --> 20:31.600
There's no need for you to make the trip.

20:33.160 --> 20:36.120
- Qingyan, follow the Xiyan delegation.
- Yes, my lord.

21:02.720 --> 21:03.880
Mei Lin?

21:09.000 --> 21:11.960
It's my failure. I couldn't protect them.

21:27.840 --> 21:28.680
Jia.

21:30.600 --> 21:31.960
Jia, wake up.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.520
Wake up.

21:38.120 --> 21:38.960
Jia.

21:45.080 --> 21:47.080
Yi. Don't sleep.

21:48.120 --> 21:48.960
Get up.

21:50.080 --> 21:50.920
Wake up.

21:51.920 --> 21:53.000
Get up.

21:56.480 --> 21:58.800
Mei Lin, I'll take them back.

22:00.360 --> 22:02.160
- I'll bring them home.
- Stay calm.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.880
They shouldn't have gone home like this.

22:03.960 --> 22:05.720
They were innocent,

22:05.800 --> 22:07.480
caught in a deadly power struggle
in Great Yan.

22:08.080 --> 22:09.440
And I'm no more than a pawn.

22:09.520 --> 22:11.920
Even with the will,
I lack the power to save them.

22:13.360 --> 22:15.120
When you left,

22:18.440 --> 22:19.680
I saw it.

22:22.920 --> 22:25.680
I saw an Eastern Palace secret guard
following you.

22:30.880 --> 22:32.520
Was this the Crown Prince's doing?

22:34.160 --> 22:35.040
Mei Lin, don't be rash.

22:36.600 --> 22:38.040
You now belong to Fanghua Palace.

22:39.200 --> 22:40.880
Our fates are intertwined.

22:42.240 --> 22:45.480
Believe me, no one will dare harm you.

22:45.560 --> 22:46.680
Live and wait for me to return.

22:47.360 --> 22:48.800
If you really want to know the truth,

22:50.240 --> 22:51.520
ask Prince Jing.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.400
The girls,

22:56.920 --> 22:58.120
I'll take them home.

22:58.840 --> 22:59.680
Mr. Yue Qin,

23:02.640 --> 23:04.240
I leave them in your care.

23:22.480 --> 23:24.520
You mustn't be seen

23:25.400 --> 23:28.320
or the Crown Prince's hands
will never be clean.

23:44.760 --> 23:46.800
I can't bear to see another Dai

23:47.480 --> 23:48.760
die in front of me.

23:51.760 --> 23:53.520
The Crown Prince couldn't deal with you,

23:53.600 --> 23:56.560
so he mimicked your burn mark to frame me,

23:56.640 --> 23:59.240
claiming I'm using the Xiyan Beauties
to bribe court officials

23:59.320 --> 24:00.680
and threaten the Crown Prince's position.

24:14.560 --> 24:16.160
What have you done?

24:37.480 --> 24:40.080
Bandits killed my Xiyan people for profit.

24:40.160 --> 24:42.280
They have been dealt with.

24:43.280 --> 24:47.000
Now, both Great Yan and Xiyan
have their answers.

24:47.080 --> 24:49.920
Mr. Yue Qin, you are so thorough.

24:51.200 --> 24:54.120
Let me beg the Crown Prince for mercy,

24:54.200 --> 24:57.000
so I can bring their bodies
back to Xiyan for burial.

24:59.200 --> 25:01.720
Mr. Yue Qin. You're also so compassionate.

25:04.720 --> 25:05.920
It's done.

25:06.000 --> 25:07.560
I must return to the Eastern Palace
to report.

25:07.640 --> 25:10.400
Farewell, Mr. Yue Qin.

25:11.280 --> 25:12.200
Farewell.

25:12.280 --> 25:17.000
GUESTS LIKE CLOUDS

25:20.440 --> 25:23.040
My lord, time is running out. We must go.

25:35.840 --> 25:38.200
The matter of the Beauties is settled.

25:38.280 --> 25:39.800
His Majesty won't see you.

25:40.400 --> 25:42.560
My lord, please return.

25:57.680 --> 25:59.360
I'll find another way.

25:59.440 --> 26:00.320
No matter what,

26:00.400 --> 26:02.600
- I won't let you--
- What did you do to those ten Beauties?

26:04.080 --> 26:06.120
The burn marks on their wrists,

26:07.640 --> 26:08.600
did you do that?

26:09.240 --> 26:10.400
Yes.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.880
I asked you before,

26:17.880 --> 26:19.120
and you lied to me.

26:19.800 --> 26:20.640
Why?

26:21.800 --> 26:23.680
You burned yourself too,
but you didn't tell me.

26:24.200 --> 26:26.760
Like you, I was buying time.

26:26.840 --> 26:30.440
But you knew Dai died because of that.

26:30.520 --> 26:31.520
I had no intention of killing anyone.

26:31.600 --> 26:33.520
But when you burned them,
you were killing them.

26:35.680 --> 26:37.920
Those ten Beauties didn't know anything.

26:38.000 --> 26:40.680
They became pawns because you chose them.

26:40.760 --> 26:42.360
And now look at them.

26:44.440 --> 26:46.000
I'm your pawn too.

26:47.880 --> 26:50.360
And I thought
we were partners in vengeance.

26:52.680 --> 26:53.720
Isn't it funny?

26:55.280 --> 26:58.320
A player and a pawn

26:59.240 --> 27:00.360
work together to win,

27:01.360 --> 27:03.280
not to flip the board.

27:04.000 --> 27:07.640
A pawn can never be a winner.

27:08.560 --> 27:11.840
All I wanted was justice for the innocent.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.080
Do you think I wanted anything different?

27:13.880 --> 27:14.720
Everything I did

27:14.800 --> 27:17.200
was to make sure the ones responsible
for the fire were punished.

27:17.280 --> 27:19.200
That the Weibei Army was vindicated.

27:19.280 --> 27:21.560
That the 100,000 innocent souls
in Qingzhou could rest in peace.

27:21.640 --> 27:23.440
But the way you seek justice

27:23.520 --> 27:25.000
for the innocent,

27:25.080 --> 27:26.240
doesn't it sound absurd even to you?

27:31.720 --> 27:35.240
Fighting the man
who slaughtered 100,000 people,

27:36.240 --> 27:38.320
does it matter if the methods are absurd?

27:40.840 --> 27:42.760
This is what sounds absurd to me.

27:46.040 --> 27:48.240
Do you know who we're up against?

27:50.480 --> 27:52.760
Our enemy is the Crown Prince.

27:54.160 --> 27:56.400
Court politics are no less brutal
than the battlefield.

27:56.480 --> 27:58.480
On the battlefield,

27:59.360 --> 28:01.120
the only thing that matters is victory.

28:09.480 --> 28:10.560
I won't work with you

28:12.760 --> 28:14.880
from this moment on.

28:54.880 --> 28:55.840
My lord,

28:55.920 --> 28:57.600
the ten Beauties have been silenced
by the Crown Prince.

28:59.680 --> 29:02.000
- What?
- When I reached the delegation,

29:02.080 --> 29:04.120
Miss Mei Lin already knew
about the deaths.

29:05.160 --> 29:07.320
Yue Qin has likely formed an alliance
with the Crown Prince.

29:08.040 --> 29:09.680
There's no way the silencing

29:09.760 --> 29:11.000
could've gone so smoothly without help.

29:15.880 --> 29:17.600
Tell me everything you know.

29:18.280 --> 29:20.560
Sir, after they loaded the bodies,
they left.

29:21.360 --> 29:24.200
I didn't see anything else.
I'll take my leave now.

29:42.760 --> 29:44.600
It's Xiyan's closed-breath pill.

29:52.000 --> 29:54.280
My lord, the manager
of the way station said

29:54.360 --> 29:56.000
Wang Quan
from the Eastern Palace was here.

29:57.080 --> 29:58.120
You were right.

29:58.720 --> 30:01.400
Yue Qin and the Crown Prince
have formed an alliance.

30:04.280 --> 30:05.200
Qingyan,

30:06.720 --> 30:07.920
we underestimated him.

30:12.200 --> 30:13.680
Mr. Yue Qin, don't worry.

30:13.760 --> 30:15.480
Thanks to the closed-breath pills,
we've deceived the Crown Prince.

30:18.200 --> 30:19.320
It is late.

30:19.400 --> 30:21.240
Let's rest briefly
and then continue on our journey.

30:29.760 --> 30:31.920
Mr. Yue Qin,
you have truly done a good job,

30:32.000 --> 30:33.240
killing two birds with one stone.

30:42.400 --> 30:44.240
My Xiyan people shouldn't die in vain.

30:44.880 --> 30:46.440
And Mei Lin
shouldn't be deceived by you either.

30:46.520 --> 30:47.640
My lord.

30:55.960 --> 30:58.160
All of you, write a letter to Mei Lin,
telling her you're safe.

31:05.400 --> 31:07.680
She's already burdened
by the 100,000 souls of Qingzhou.

31:07.760 --> 31:10.880
Don't add ten more lives to that burden.

31:11.520 --> 31:12.840
No need for them to write.

31:16.080 --> 31:17.080
This letter

31:17.160 --> 31:19.160
was meant to be delivered to her
upon our return to Xiyan.

31:19.680 --> 31:21.200
But since you're here,

31:21.280 --> 31:23.360
I'll leave it in your care.

31:24.880 --> 31:26.720
TO MEI LIN

31:26.800 --> 31:29.400
Your Highness, your lies will be exposed.

31:29.480 --> 31:31.720
There's no need for me
to use all these lives for a charade.

31:32.840 --> 31:35.800
Murong Jinghe, you are not worthy
of walking this path with her.

31:36.520 --> 31:37.360
Let's go.

31:51.040 --> 31:52.360
Aren't you going to read the letter?

31:55.640 --> 31:57.200
At least he won't harm her.

31:57.280 --> 32:00.520
But what if Mr. Yue Qin
added lies to the letter?

32:01.080 --> 32:03.320
Then Miss Mei Lin will hate you even more.

32:07.160 --> 32:08.000
The letter is meant for her.

32:09.400 --> 32:10.600
I shouldn't read it.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.040
FANGHUA PALACE

32:15.120 --> 32:16.840
I've noticed
you haven't been happy lately.

32:17.440 --> 32:19.360
Are you not used to it here?

32:19.440 --> 32:20.280
No.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.840
I know Fanghua Palace has a lot of rules,

32:24.480 --> 32:26.640
but we can find ways around them.

32:27.320 --> 32:29.240
Look. I brought you something.

32:34.320 --> 32:37.120
This is the bamboo brew
my brother left behind.

32:37.200 --> 32:39.440
Now, we can drink whenever we want.

32:40.600 --> 32:42.240
I know you like drinking.

32:42.320 --> 32:45.400
Whenever I'm unhappy,
I drink this bamboo brew.

32:49.440 --> 32:51.520
- Come, Your Highness.
- Cheers!

32:57.440 --> 32:59.400
I'll tell you something.
On the day of the ennobling ceremony,

32:59.480 --> 33:02.160
Prince Jing came to see His Majesty,
hoping to take you back to his mansion.

33:02.240 --> 33:04.160
But His Majesty turned him away.

33:04.240 --> 33:06.080
I thought he'd make a scene,

33:06.760 --> 33:08.480
but he's been surprisingly quiet.

33:12.720 --> 33:13.560
Your Highness,

33:14.960 --> 33:16.160
Prince Jing wants to see you.

33:24.480 --> 33:27.040
Prince Jing. This is Fanghua Palace.
I have an imperial decree.

33:27.120 --> 33:28.480
You can't take her away.

33:31.080 --> 33:32.320
Your Highness, you need not worry.

33:33.000 --> 33:34.680
Since Mei Lin has been assigned
to Fanghua Palace,

33:35.560 --> 33:37.320
I wouldn't dare take her away.

33:38.320 --> 33:41.360
I just want to say a few words.
Then I'll leave.

33:58.520 --> 33:59.680
I won't work with you

34:00.480 --> 34:02.840
from this moment on.

34:19.880 --> 34:22.920
I have nothing more to say to you.

34:27.520 --> 34:29.080
Those Beauties aren't dead.

34:34.760 --> 34:36.280
Even if you don't trust me,

34:39.040 --> 34:39.960
trust him.

34:50.679 --> 34:53.560
TO MEI LIN

34:53.639 --> 34:55.199
Mei Lin, do not worry.

34:56.280 --> 34:58.200
The girls have safely returned to Xiyan.

34:58.880 --> 35:01.400
I kept the truth hidden out of necessity

35:01.480 --> 35:03.400
to deceive the Crown Prince.

35:04.440 --> 35:07.400
Take care. Live and wait for me to return.

35:10.160 --> 35:13.200
I never intended to kill them.

35:16.320 --> 35:17.160
I know.

35:19.920 --> 35:21.640
But their lives

35:22.960 --> 35:25.600
were never your priority.

35:44.160 --> 35:45.760
This was meant for you.

35:47.240 --> 35:48.520
I brought it from Shuanglin Courtyard.

35:50.120 --> 35:52.080
Since we're going our separate ways,

35:53.960 --> 35:56.920
there's no need
to pretend you love me anymore.

36:10.920 --> 36:11.760
Goodbye.

36:22.560 --> 36:27.960
FRAGRANT WATERSIDE

36:36.800 --> 36:37.640
My lord.

36:38.880 --> 36:40.760
Since you're already in the palace,

36:40.840 --> 36:43.280
His Majesty wishes to see you.

37:00.360 --> 37:02.680
Father. Please, have some tea.

37:03.560 --> 37:04.400
What?

37:05.240 --> 37:06.320
You think I'm nagging?

37:08.200 --> 37:10.520
Father, I understand your intentions.

37:10.600 --> 37:13.560
Since you understand, you're not
to visit Fanghua Palace anymore.

37:15.120 --> 37:17.840
Son, it's time you took a wife.

37:17.920 --> 37:20.320
Your mother indulged your whims,

37:20.960 --> 37:22.600
but I won't.

37:27.040 --> 37:28.160
General Yin is here.

37:29.920 --> 37:32.280
Your Majesty. My respects.

37:32.880 --> 37:33.880
General Yin, you may rise.

37:36.720 --> 37:37.720
The hunt in Lushan is approaching.

37:37.800 --> 37:41.000
I've checked the spots.
Everything is ready.

37:41.080 --> 37:43.600
Great. General Yin, sit.

37:51.880 --> 37:55.240
Luomei, you've returned to the capital,

37:55.840 --> 37:57.440
and it's time you thought about marriage.

37:58.040 --> 38:01.080
With Great Yan's borders unsettled, I…

38:01.760 --> 38:04.240
Marriage and succession
are the natural order.

38:04.920 --> 38:08.000
We cannot delay your future
for public affairs.

38:09.240 --> 38:11.120
Don't worry.

38:11.720 --> 38:14.960
Choose according to your heart.

38:21.520 --> 38:23.920
My focus is on serving the empire,
not marriage.

38:24.000 --> 38:24.840
How about this?

38:24.920 --> 38:27.840
The one who claims the prize
at the spring hunt,

38:27.920 --> 38:30.280
no matter their status,
will be my future spouse.

38:32.000 --> 38:33.240
Very well.

38:33.880 --> 38:35.240
The champion will be a hero,

38:35.320 --> 38:37.600
worthy of General Yin.

38:37.680 --> 38:38.680
Jinghe,

38:38.760 --> 38:40.320
I remember

38:40.400 --> 38:43.080
you were the champion every year.

38:43.160 --> 38:46.280
I'm sure this year will be no different.

38:48.840 --> 38:50.680
If Prince Jing aims to win,

38:51.280 --> 38:53.360
the prize is certainly his.

38:53.440 --> 38:54.360
Good.

38:55.280 --> 38:57.360
After the spring hunt,
I'll issue the decree.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.120
Father,

39:00.880 --> 39:03.520
my body is no longer what it was.

39:03.600 --> 39:06.000
These days, I can only hunt rabbits.

39:08.320 --> 39:11.000
I've promised General Yin
that she will have the final say.

39:12.080 --> 39:16.080
Whoever she chooses, I'll grant it.

39:18.040 --> 39:20.680
At the spring hunt,
I'll give Your Majesty an answer.

39:29.080 --> 39:32.120
FANGHUA PALACE

39:45.120 --> 39:48.280
I never intended to kill them.

40:21.840 --> 40:23.440
My mansion recently hired a chef
from Qingzhou.

40:24.160 --> 40:27.160
When you come,
and once your taste returns,

40:27.760 --> 40:29.280
whether the chef is a good one or not,

40:29.360 --> 40:30.760
you can judge his cooking yourself.

40:38.720 --> 40:41.080
I'll be holding onto your hairpin for now.

40:41.920 --> 40:44.000
Once we've taken down the Crown Prince,

40:45.000 --> 40:48.520
If you want to talk to your mother,
come to me.

40:55.080 --> 40:57.160
SHUANGLIN COURTYARD

41:18.920 --> 41:19.760
Mother,

41:21.480 --> 41:23.320
what kind of person is he?

41:25.000 --> 41:26.080
I can't tell.

41:27.960 --> 41:31.040
Mei Lin. Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

41:31.120 --> 41:32.000
- Mei Lin!
- Your Highness.

41:32.080 --> 41:34.200
Do not worry.
Prince Jing won't bother you anymore.

41:34.280 --> 41:37.480
His Majesty has forbidden him
from visiting Fanghua Palace.

41:44.800 --> 41:46.160
SHUANGLIN COURTYARD

41:48.360 --> 41:50.200
Is this painted by Prince Jing?

41:54.680 --> 41:57.600
Could it be that the rumors
about his love for you

41:57.680 --> 41:59.160
are true after all?

42:01.960 --> 42:03.000
No.

42:03.080 --> 42:05.520
Prince Jing can't possibly be sincere.

42:06.240 --> 42:07.720
My mother said

42:07.800 --> 42:09.440
the ones who truly care for you
in the palace

42:09.520 --> 42:11.040
are those who love you quietly.

42:11.640 --> 42:14.000
Loud displays of affection
only bring harm.

42:14.080 --> 42:16.320
There must be a hidden agenda
behind his affection for you.

42:16.400 --> 42:17.360
No.

42:17.880 --> 42:20.520
We need to pray to the gods
to make him stop pestering you.

42:21.480 --> 42:22.560
Pray to the gods?

42:25.720 --> 42:28.200
This is our Xiyan Forget-Sorrow Flower.

42:28.880 --> 42:31.200
When you use it to pray to the gods,

42:31.280 --> 42:32.560
if it sinks to the bottom of the water,

42:32.640 --> 42:35.360
you'll never see the person
who troubles you again.

42:44.680 --> 42:45.960
Forget-Sorrow Flower.

42:47.720 --> 42:50.000
It works.

42:50.080 --> 42:51.240
When Ziyu bullied me,

42:51.320 --> 42:53.520
I prayed with the Forget-Sorrow Flower,

42:54.960 --> 42:56.480
and the next day,
I was in the peace-making marriage.

43:12.000 --> 43:14.720
Whether he loves me or not,

43:15.560 --> 43:18.400
we've already become strangers.
It doesn't matter anymore.

43:22.120 --> 43:23.160
Let's go, Your Highness.

43:23.680 --> 43:25.800
Wait!

43:25.880 --> 43:26.720
It's about to sink!

43:27.520 --> 43:28.360
Just wait a little longer.

43:34.960 --> 43:36.640
The paper flower is already wet.

43:38.240 --> 43:39.480
It'll sink sooner or later.

43:43.560 --> 43:44.440
Let's go.

44:19.880 --> 44:22.680
SHUANGLIN COURTYARD
